# Generated by suievals/build.js at deploy time, one HTML and one JSON per run
# that ranks on the board.
#
# It was committed, and it was 2.7M of a 6.1M repository -- the largest thing in
# it, and growing by two files per published card. `npx skills add
# mystenlabs/skills` clones the whole repository to install skills from it, so
# every user downloaded all of it to use none of it.
#
# Derivable, too: a rebuild emits exactly the records the current board links to.
# Of the 39 files committed here, a build regenerated 10 -- the rest were records
# of runs that stopped ranking when #106 renamed the suite, still in the tree
# with nothing pointing at them.
suievals/runs/
